eak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のお洋服は\nヨーロッパの小学生のイメージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリッ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/09/14/7811983/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会は9月21日\n名古屋でお待ちしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/09/14/7811983/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/09/14/7811983/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎新学期始まって\nめっちゃキツいんすけど、\n絢音さんは朝起きれるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も朝は苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎朝、お母さんとお兄ちゃんに\n起こしてもらってます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎次回のブログまでに\n映画見ちゃってるかもだけど、\n何の映画見る予定なのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ観てないんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週\nテストが終わったら\n観に行きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみー(OvO)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎お化け屋敷に\n他のメンバー挑戦してたけど、\nあーちゃんは お化けとか、\n心霊スポット的なものは\nイケるほう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は怖がりなので\nお化けとかダメなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし見えちゃったら\nどうしようとか\n考えちゃいます(u_u)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎絢音、\nいつも学校帰りに\nコメントの確認してるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":